    {
      "text": "teachers are ordained after manner of God’s holy order, 2 Ne. 6:2 (Alma 5:44; 6:8; 13:1–3, 6–11; 43:2; Hel. 8:18; Ether 12:10). of increase of government and peace there is no end upon his kingdom to order it, 2 Ne. 19:7 (Isa. 9:7). all things must be done in order, Mosiah 4:27. high priesthood of holy order of God, Alma 4:20 (13:1, 6–11). Alma2 establishes order of Church, Alma 6:4 (8:1). high priesthood after order of the Son, Alma 13:2, 6–9 (Hel. 8:18). apostates are after order of Nehors, Alma 14:16 (21:4; 24:28). all things should be restored to proper order, Alma 41:2. great order in the land, 3 Ne. 6:4. Nephites are without order and mercy, Moro. 9:18.",
